                                "sense_id": "556037ef-7cb2-3ea3-b160-8b31141d2dbb",
                                "text": "I can say that our organization is supportful of the actions on behalf of many farm groups to stop the initiatives that are being led by the current administration, to remove article 22 and article 11 at the GATT talks."
